stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    state "Checking" as Checking
    state "Warming · model loading" as Warming
    state "Connected · Kokoro voices" as Connected
    state "Offline · system voice" as Fallback
    state "Offline · error + Retry" as Error
    [*] --> Checking : popup opens
    Checking --> Connected : model loaded
    Checking --> Warming : helper answers
    Checking --> Fallback : no helper
    Checking --> Error : engine stopped · no reply
    Warming --> Connected : /health every 2 s
    Connected --> Fallback : Speak finds no helper
    Fallback --> Checking : Retry
    Error --> Checking : Retry
